ASxxxx Assembler V02.00 + NoICE + SDCC mods  (Intel 8051)               Page 1
Hexadecimal [24-Bits]



                                      1 ; Keep UPOKE.BIN on the card. The file loader (bank04:8000, CODE:0E3E) deletes every file it has loaded
                                      2 ; (bank04:81E3 LCALL 1066, needed for UPDATE.TXT). That call now comes here and skips the delete only for our
                                      3 ; boot hook's request (generic name pointer 01:6BF0, see poke_b10.asm).
                                      4 
                                      5         .area   CODE (ABS)
      00DA00                          6         .org    0xDA00
                                      7 
      00DA00 BB 01 07         [24]    8 nodel:  cjne    r3,#0x01,del
      00DA03 BA 6B 04         [24]    9         cjne    r2,#0x6B,del
      00DA06 B9 F0 01         [24]   10         cjne    r1,#0xF0,del
      00DA09 22               [24]   11         ret
      00DA0A 02 10 66         [24]   12 del:    ljmp    0x1066
